data: {"id": "caad11e0b25f4f6a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1301", "run_id": "caad11e0b25f4f6a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到关键事实，但证据存在明显冲突：\n\n**支持 NotReady 的证据：**\n- Kubernetes 状态：Pod `phase=Running`，但 `Ready=False`，`ContainersReady=False`，条件为 `ContainersNotReady`，消息显示 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n- Events：存在 `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` 的持续告警（x2182）。\n- 日志：应用日志显示 `level=error, message=dependency unavailable, http_status=503`，每 2s 一次。\n\n**反驳/冲突的证据（不支持 NotReady）：**\n- 根据 `kubectl_get_yaml` 结果，`containerStatuses` 中 `app` 容器的 `ready=False`，但 `restarts=0` 且 `exitCode=None`。通", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093294307, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

